          "en": "if invalid data is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 34.74,
          "en": "But I'll get back to this later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.74,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "For the moment, I wanna focus on this success case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.89,
          "end": 41.196,
          "en": "And again, I'll add setTimeout here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.196,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "to wait for 1 1/2 half seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 47.733,
          "en": "before sending this success response, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "Just as before, we should restart that backend server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 54.333,
          "en": "for these changes to be active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "Now I'm doing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 60.093,
          "en": "because I wanna show you that if you add a new event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.41,
          "end": 63.093,
          "en": "as I'm doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.99,
          "end": 66.66,
          "en": "the submission will now take a short while.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.66,
          "end": 70.32,
          "en": "And just as before, when we navigate it to a different page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.32,
          "end": 73.932,
          "en": "we don't get any feedback regarding that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.932,
          "end": 75.93,
          "en": "And it would be nice to get some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.93,
          "end": 78.53999999999999,
          "en": "and maybe also to disable the save button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.53999999999999,
          "end": 80.94,
          "en": "so that users don't try to submit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.94,
          "end": 83.043,
          "en": "the same form multiple times.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 87.24,
          "en": "Now we can get and incorporate that feedback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.24,
          "end": 89.223,
          "en": "just as we did it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.138,
          "end": 93.27000000000001,
          "en": "I, by the way, also added programmatic navigation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.27000000000001,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "for this cancelHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 97.38,
          "en": "but that's not too important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.38,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "Instead, I wanna use a hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 101.4,
          "en": "that sounds familiar to useNavigate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.4,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "but works totally different, the useNavigation hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 107.703,
          "en": "And that's a hook we already saw in action before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 110.34,
          "en": "It's provided by React Router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.34,
          "end": 112.86,
          "en": "and gives us access to a navigation object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.86,
          "end": 115.62,
          "en": "And we can extract various pieces of information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.62,
          "end": 116.88,
          "en": "from that object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 119.553,
          "en": "For example, all the data that was submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 123.84,
          "en": "But we can also find out what the current state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.84,
          "end": 127.14,
          "en": "of the currently active transition is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.14,
          "end": 130.77,
          "en": "And we have a transition from one route to another",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.77,
          "end": 132.3,
          "en": "if we click a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 135.69,
          "en": "But we also have a transition if we submit a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.69,
          "end": 137.49,
          "en": "And therefore, we also get information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.49,
          "end": 140.46,
          "en": "about the current data submission process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.46,
          "end": 142.56,
          "en": "and whether it completed already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 146.343,
          "en": "So whether the action that was triggered completed already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 150.5,
          "en": "So here, we can add a helper constant called isSubmitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.82999999999998,
          "end": 154.2,
          "en": "And in there, I simply store the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.2,
          "end": 159.2,
          "en": "of comparing navigation.state to submitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.26,
          "end": 162.69,
          "en": "If the current state is submitting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.69,
          "end": 165.39,
          "en": "I know that we are currently submitting data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "so that the action that was triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 169.92000000000002,
          "en": "is currently still active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.92000000000002,
          "end": 173.34,
          "en": "And we can use this isSubmitting field here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.34,
          "end": 176.82,
          "en": "to for example, disable this Save button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.82,
          "end": 181.82,
          "en": "We can disable it by simply setting this to isSubmitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.074,
          "end": 184.713,
          "en": "So if we are submitting, this button is disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.67,
          "end": 189.423,
          "en": "We can do the same for the Cancel button, if we want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 192.75,
          "en": "We can also change the text of the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.75,
          "end": 194.49,
          "en": "and check if we are submitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.49,
          "end": 197.88,
          "en": "In which case, I'll set the text to Submitting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.88,
          "end": 200.673,
          "en": "and only otherwise, I'll set it to Save.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.44,
          "end": 206.133,
          "en": "With that done, we can add a new event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 207.27,
          "end": 208.173,
          "en": "Testing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 213.993,
          "en": "Set it to any date of course, and add any text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.31,
          "end": 218.76,
          "en": "And if I click Save, you see this changed to Submitting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.76,
          "end": 222.21,
          "en": "and I now get some feedback that something's going on here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.21,
          "end": 225.183,
          "en": "which is better than having no feedback at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 227.49,
          "en": "With that done though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.49,
          "end": 229.59,
          "en": "I can go back to this backend code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.59,
          "end": 232.32,
          "en": "and again, remove this set timeout code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.32,
          "end": 234.72,
          "en": "from this routes events.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.72,
          "end": 236.46,
          "en": "because that was just a demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.46,
          "end": 237.96,
          "en": "But it's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.96,
          "end": 240.543,
          "en": "how you can manage those different states.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
